  "details": "I really enjoy this game, but the fps caps and unoptimized character models are really making it a pain to keep playing. I get very frequent headaches and an insanely fast increasing heart rate when playing this game due to lag. I am aware that this is mainly from SteamVR handling the VR and touch controllers (using Oculus)\n\nPC:\n8GB ram\nI5 3570k\nGTX 1060\nPlaying in VR mode\n\nI should be able to play without any issues, but immediately upon entering the hub, I'm greeted by violent screen juddering that only slightly goes away when all the character models have loaded. The 45fps cap doesn't really keep things smooth. It just locks you at a lower framerate than what you could be getting just because of a minor lag issue. \n\nAll in all, I probably don't know what I'm talking about because I'm not developing it, but I do know that the game ran tons better when it didn't require SteamVR to play.",
